hadiths[39]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1296","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ham Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath khanay par haazir hotay to apne haath na rakhtay thay yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) shuru kartay aur apna haath rakhtay. Aur beshak ham Aap ke saath aik baar khanay par haazir hue to aik londi aayi goya dhakeli ja rahi thi. To wo khanay mein apna haath rakhnay lagi to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ka haath pakar liya. Phir aik dehati aaya goya dhakela ja raha tha. To Aap ne us ka haath pakar liya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak shaitaan khanay ko halal samajhta hai jis par Allah ka naam na liya gaya ho. Aur beshak wo is londi ko le kar aaya taake us ke zariye (khanay ko) halal kar le, to main ne us ka haath pakar liya. Phir wo is dehati ko le kar aaya taake us ke zariye (khanay ko) halal kar le, to main ne us ka haath pakar liya. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak us ka haath mere haath mein hai us (londi) ke haath sameet. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Phir Aap ne Allah ka naam liya aur khaya. (Muslim: 6/107-108)"
"1297","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Jab aadmi apne ghar mein dakhil ho aur Allah ka zikr karay apne dakhil honay par aur apne khanay par to shaitaan kehta hai: Tumharay liye na raat guzarnay ki jagah hai aur na shaam ka khana. Aur jab wo dakhil ho aur Allah ka zikr na karay apne dakhil honay par to shaitaan kehta hai: Tum ne raat guzarnay ki jagah pa li. Aur jab wo Allah ka zikr na karay apne khanay par to kehta hai: Tum ne raat guzarnay ki jagah aur shaam ka khana pa liya. (Muslim: 6/108). Baab: Daayein haath se khana."
"1298","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaye to apne daayein (haath) se khaye, aur jab piye to apne daayein (haath) se piye, beshak shaitaan apne baayein (haath) se khata hai aur apne baayein (haath) se peeta hai. (Muslim: 6/109)"
"1299","[AI-translation] Iyas bin Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhuma) se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne unhein bataya ke aik mard ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas baayein (haath) se khaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne daayein (haath) se khao. Us ne kaha: Main taqat nahi rakhta. Aap ne farmaya: Tum taqat na rakho. Usay takabbur ke siwa kisi ne nahi roka tha. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne usay apne munh tak na uthaya. (Muslim: 6/109). Baab: Khanay walay ke qareeb se khana."
"1300","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abu Salama (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki god mein tha aur mera haath pyalay mein idhar udhar lagta tha. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae larkay! Allah ka naam lo, apne daayein (haath) se khao aur apne qareeb se khao. (Muslim: 6/109). (Tateesh se murad pyalay ke kinaron ki taraf haath ka hilna hai; Tabrani ki riwayat mein hai ke kaho: Bismillah.)"
"1301","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) teen ungliyon se khatay aur apna haath ponchnay se pehle chaat-tay. (Muslim: 6/114). Baab: Jab khaye to haath chaatay ya chatwaye."
"1302","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khana khaye to apna haath na ponchay yahan tak ke usay chaatay ya chatwaye. (Muslim: 6/113). Baab: Ungliyon aur pyalay ko chaatna."
"1303","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ungliyon aur pyalay ko chaatnay ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Beshak tum nahi jantay ke barkat kin mein hai. (Muslim: 6/114). Baab: Girnay wali luqmay ko saaf kar ke khana."
"1304","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Beshak shaitaan tum mein se aik ke paas us ke har muamlay mein haazir hota hai yahan tak ke us ke khanay par us ke paas haazir hota hai. To jab tum mein se kisi ki luqma gir jaye to jo naagawari us par ho usay door karay phir usay khaye aur usay shaitaan ke liye na chhoray. Phir jab farigh ho to apni ungliyan chaatay, beshak wo nahi janta ke us ke khanay mein se kis mein barkat hai. (Muslim: 6/114). Baab: Khanay peenay par Allah ki hamd ke baaray mein."
"1305","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah banday se raazi hota hai ke wo luqma khaye aur us par us ki hamd karay, aur ghoont piye aur us par us ki hamd karay. (Muslim: 8/87). Baab: Khanay peenay ki nemat ke baaray mein sawal."
"1306","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik din ya raat niklay aur Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se milay. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhein is waqt apne gharon se kis ne nikala? Unhon ne kaha: Bhook ne, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Aur main bhi, us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, jis ne tumhein nikala usi ne mujhe nikala. Khaday ho jao. To wo Aap ke saath khaday hue. To Aap Ansaar mein se aik mard ke paas aaye jabke wo apne ghar mein na tha. Phir jab aurat ne Aap ko dekha to kaha: Khush aamdeed. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Falan kahan hai? Us ne kaha: Wo hamaray liye meetha pani lanay gaya hai. Phir Ansari mard aaya aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke donon saathiyon ko dekh kar kaha: Alhamdulillah! Aaj mujh se zyada mehmaan nawaz koi nahi. Phir wo gaya aur khajoor ka guchha laya jis mein kachi, khushk aur taza khajoorein thin, aur kaha: Is mein se khao. Phir us ne chhuri li, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Doodh wali bakri zibah na karna. To us ne doosri bakri zibah ki, aur sab ne us ka gosht khaya, khajoorein khayein aur pani piya. Phir jab sair ho gaye to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, qayamat ke din tum se is nemat ke baaray mein poocha jaye ga: Tum apne gharon se bhook ki wajah se niklay aur wapas na hue yahan tak ke tumhein ye nemat mili. (Muslim)."
"1307","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka aik Farsi parosi tha jo achay shorbay wala tha. To us ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye (khana) banaya phir Aap ko bulanay aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Aur ye, Aisha ki taraf ishara kar ke, yani kya tum isay bhi bulatay ho? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, yani main nahi aaun ga. Phir wo Aap ko bulanay aaya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur ye? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi. Phir wo Aap ko bulanay aaya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur ye? Us ne teesri baar kaha: Haan. To donon khaday hue aur aik doosray ke peechay chaltay hue us ke ghar aaye. (Muslim: 6/116). Baab: Jo khanay ki dawat diya jaye aur us ke peechay ghair aaye. (Izq se murad khajoor ka guchha hai jo khajoor ke darakht ki tehni hai; yatataba'an se murad har aik ka apne saathi ke peechay chalna hai.)"
"1308","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansaar mein se aik mard tha jinhein Abu Shuaib kaha jata tha, aur un ka aik qasai ghulam tha. To us ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha aur Aap ke chehray mein bhook pehchani. To us ne apne ghulam se kaha: Tera bura ho, hamaray liye paanch afraad ka khana bana, beshak main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko paanch mein se panchwan bulanay ka irada rakhta hun. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne banaya, phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko paanch mein se panchwan bulaya, aur un ke peechay aik mard chal para. Phir jab darwazay tak pahunche to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye hamaray peechay aaya hai. To agar tum chaho to usay ijazat do, aur agar tum chaho to wo wapas jaye. Us ne kaha: Nahi, balke main usay ijazat deta hun, Ae Allah ke Rasool! (Muslim: 6/115). Baab: Mehmaan ko tarjeeh denay ke baaray mein."
"1309","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard, asal mein hai ke dehati, Muslim mein hai ke mard, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak main mashaqqat mein hun. To Aap ne apni baaz biwiyon ki taraf bheja. To unhon ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke saath bheja, mere paas pani ke siwa kuch nahi. Phir doosri ki taraf bheja to unhon ne usi tarah kaha, yahan tak ke sab azwaaj ne usi tarah kaha. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aaj raat is ki mehmaan nawazi kaun karay ga? Allah us par rehem karay. To Ansaar mein se aik mard khada hua aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main karun ga. To wo usay apne ghar le gaya aur apni biwi se kaha: Kya tumharay paas kuch hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, bachon ke khanay ke siwa kuch nahi. Us ne kaha: Bachon ko kisi cheez se behla do, aur jab hamara mehmaan dakhil ho aur ham khanay lagein to chiragh bujha dena. To jab wo khanay lagay to wo uthi aur chiragh bujha diya. (Rawi kehtay hain) wo baithay, mehmaan ne khaya, aur miyan biwi ne aisa hi kiya, aur miyan biwi bhookay rahay jabke mehmaan ne khana khaya. Subah wo Ansari Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah tum donon ke mehmaan ke saath kiye par khush hua. (Muslim)."
"1310","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Do ka khana teen ko kaafi hai, aur teen ka khana chaar ko kaafi hai. (Muslim: 6/132)"
"1311","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Aik ka khana do ko kaafi hai, do ka khana chaar ko kaafi hai, aur chaar ka khana aath ko kaafi hai. (Muslim: 6/132). Baab: Momin aik aant mein khata hai aur kafir saat aanton mein."
"1312","[AI-translation] Jabir aur Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin aik aant mein khata hai aur kafir saat aanton mein khata hai. (Muslim: 6/133)"
"1313","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik mehmaan aaya jabke wo kafir tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke liye bakri ka hukm diya. To wo dohi gayi aur us ne us ka doodh piya, phir doosri, to usay piya, yahan tak ke us ne saat bakriyon ka doodh piya. Phir wo subah Musalman ho gaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke liye bakri ka hukm diya. To us ne us ka doodh piya, phir doosri ka hukm diya to usay poora na pi saka. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin aik aant mein peeta hai aur kafir saat aanton mein peeta hai. (Muslim: 6/133). Baab: Kaddu khanay ke baaray mein."
"1314","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dawat di. To main Aap ke saath chala. To shorba laya gaya jis mein kaddu tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us kaddu mein se khanay lagay aur Aap ko pasand aaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab main ne ye dekha to main usay Aap ki taraf dalnay laga aur khud na khata tha. Unhon ne kaha: To Anas ne kaha: Us ke baad mujhe hamesha kaddu pasand raha. (Muslim: 6/121)"
"1315","[AI-translation] Talha bin Nafi se, Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se sama ke sath riwayat hai, wo kehtay thay: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik din mera haath pakra aur apne ghar ki taraf le gaye. To Aap ke paas roti ke tukray laye gaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Koi salan nahi? To unhon ne kaha: Nahi, siwae thori sirka ke. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak sirka achha salan hai. Jabir ne kaha: To jab se main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ye suna, mujhe hamesha sirka pasand raha. Aur Talha ne kaha: Jab se main ne Jabir se ye suna, mujhe hamesha sirka pasand raha. (Muslim: 6/125). Baab: Khajoor khana aur guthli do ungliyon ke darmiyan dalna."
"1316","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Busr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere walid ke paas mehman hue. Unhon ne kaha: To ham ne Aap ke paas khana aur hais qareeb kiya. To Aap ne us mein se khaya. Phir khajoor layi gayi. To Aap usay khatay thay aur guthli apni do ungliyon ke darmiyan daltay thay, aur shahadat aur darmiyani ungli ko jamatay thay. Shuba ne kaha: Ye mera guman hai, aur wo is mein hai inshaAllah Taala, guthli ka do ungliyon ke darmiyan dalna. Phir sharbat laya gaya. To Aap ne piya, phir apne daayein walay ko diya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mere walid ne kaha aur Aap ki sawari ki mahar pakri: Hamaray liye Allah se dua kijiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Unhein jo Tune diya us mein barkat de, unhein bakhsh de aur un par rehem kar. (Muslim: 6/122). Baab: Ukroon baith kar khajoor khana. (Hais khajoor, paneer aur ghee ka halwa hai; Shuba ne kaha ke mera khayal hai ke guthli dalna hadees mein mazkoor hai, doosri sanad mein baghair shak sabit hai.)"
"1317","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas khajoor layi gayi. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usay taqseem karnay lagay jabke Aap jaldi mein thay, ghair jami hui nashist se, us mein se khoob kha rahay thay. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ukroon baith kar khajoor khatay dekha. (Muslim: 6/122). Baab: Jis ghar mein khajoor na ho us ke ghar walay bhookay hain. (Muhtafiz se murad jaldi karnay wala, nashist mein ghair jama hua hai; ye Bukhari ki hadees main tek laga kar nahi khata ke mani mein hai.)"
"1318","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Jis ghar mein khajoor na ho us ke ghar walay bhookay hain. Ae Aisha! Jis ghar mein khajoor na ho us ke ghar walay bhookay hain, ya us ke ghar walay bhookay ho gaye. Aap ne ye do ya teen baar farmaya. (Muslim: 6/123). Baab: Khajoor mein do ko milanay se mumaniat."
"1319","[AI-translation] Jabala bin Suhaim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Zubair (raziyallahu anhuma) hamein khajoor detay thay jabke log tangi mein thay. Ham kha rahay thay ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) guzray aur kaha: Do khajoorein aik saath na khao, beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is se mana farmaya hai, siwae is ke ke tum apne bhai se ijazat lo. Shuba ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke ijazat ka qaul Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se hai. (Muslim)."
"1320","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Jafar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kakri taza khajoor se khatay dekha. (Muslim: 6/122). Baab: Kaalay kabas ke baaray mein. (Aik hadees mein hai ke Aap tarbooz taza khajoor se khatay thay aur farmatay thay ke is ki garmi ko is ki thandak se tortay hain.)"
"1321","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Marr-uz-Zahran mein thay jabke ham kabas tor rahay thay. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us mein se kaalay lo. Unhon ne kaha: To ham ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Goya Aap ne bakriyan charayein hain. Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur koi Nabi nahi magar us ne bakriyan charayein, ya is jaisa qaul. (Muslim: 6/125). Baab: Khargosh khana. (Marr-uz-Zahran Makka se aik manzil se kam par mashhoor jagah hai; kabas arak ke phal mein paka hua hai.)"
"1322","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham guzray aur Marr-uz-Zahran mein khargosh ko daudaya. To wo us ke peechay dauday aur thak gaye. Unhon ne kaha: To main dauda yahan tak ke usay paa liya. Phir main usay Abu Talha ke paas laya. To unhon ne usay zibah kiya. Phir us ki surin aur us ki raanon ka gosht Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf bheja. To main usay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya aur Aap ne usay qabool kiya. (Muslim: 6/71). Baab: Gooh khanay ke baaray mein. (Istanfajna se murad daudana hai; laghabna se murad thakna hai.)"
"1323","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat hai ke Khalid bin Waleed (raziyallahu anhu), jinhein Allah ki talwaar kaha jata hai, ne unhein bataya ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Maimuna ke paas dakhil hue, aur wo un ki khala thin aur Ibn Abbas ki khala thin. To unhon ne un ke paas gooh ka bhuna gosht paya jo Maimuna ki behan Hufaida bint Haris Najd se layi thin. Phir unhon ne wo gooh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay rakhi, aur kam hi hota ke Aap ke saamnay khana rakha jata aur us ka naam na bataya jata. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne gooh ki taraf apna haath badhaya to wahan mojood auraton mein se aik ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko batao jo Aap ke saamnay rakha gaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye gooh hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna haath hata liya. Khalid bin Waleed (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya gooh haraam hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar wo meri zameen mein nahi payi jati, to main usay napasand karta hun. Khalid (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Phir main ne usay apni taraf khencha aur khaya, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujhe dekhtay rahay aur mujhe mana nahi farmaya. (Muslim)."
"1324","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehati Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak main nashibi zameen mein hun jo gooh wali hai, aur beshak wo mere ghar walon ka aam khana hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne usay jawab na diya. To ham ne kaha: Dobara poocho. To us ne dobara poocha aur Aap ne usay jawab na diya, teen baar. Phir teesri baar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay pukara aur farmaya: Ae dehati! Beshak Allah ne Bani Israil ke aik giroh par lanat ya ghussa kiya aur unhein zameen mein rengnay wali cheezon mein maskh kar diya. To main nahi janta ke shayad ye unhi mein se hai. To main usay nahi khata aur na us se manay karta hun. (Muslim: 6/70). Baab: Tiddi khana."
"1325","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Aufa (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath saat ghazwaat mein tiddi khayi. (Muslim: 6/70). Baab: Samandari janwar aur jo (machli) wo phenkay us ka khana."
"1326","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein bheja aur ham par Abu Ubaida ko ameer banaya taake ham Quraish ke qafilay ka isteqbal karein. Aur Aap ne hamein khajoor ka thaila tosha diya, hamaray liye us ke siwa kuch na paya. To Abu Ubaida hamein aik aik khajoor detay thay. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Tum us se kya kartay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Ham usay choostay thay jaisa bacha choosta hai, phir us par pani peetay thay. To wo hamein din bhar raat tak kaafi hoti. Aur ham apni laathiyon se darakhton ke pattay jhaadtay thay, phir usay pani se bhigo kar khatay thay. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ham samandar ke kinare chalay. To samandar ke kinare hamaray liye baray teelay jaisi cheez buland hui. To ham us ke paas aaye to wo janwar tha jisay ambar kehtay hain. Unhon ne kaha: Abu Ubaida ne kaha: Murdaar hai. Phir kaha: Nahi, balke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke bhejay hue hain aur Allah ke rastay mein hain, aur tum majboor ho gaye ho, to khao. Unhon ne kaha: To ham wahan aik maheena thehray jabke ham teen sau thay yahan tak ke motay ho gaye. Aur beshak main ne hamein dekha ke ham us ki aankh ke garhay se gharon se charbi nikal rahay thay, aur us mein se bail jaisay tukray kaat-tay thay. To Abu Ubaida ne ham mein se terah mardon ko liya aur unhein us ki aankh ke garhay mein bithaya, aur us ki pasliyon mein se aik pasli li aur usay khada kiya, phir hamaray sab se baray oont par kajaawa rakha aur wo us ke neechay se guzra. Aur ham ne us ke gosht se safar ka tosha banaya. Phir jab ham Madina aaye to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo rizq tha jo Allah ne tumharay liye nikala. Kya tumharay paas us ke gosht mein se kuch hai? Hamein bhi khilao. Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: To ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas us ke gosht mein se kuch bheja aur Aap ne khaya. (Muslim). (Jirab khajoor ka thaila hai; khabt darakht ke pattay hain; Abu Ubaida ne pehle ijtihad se kaha ke ye murdaar hai, phir ijtihad badal gaya; waqb aankh ka garha hai; qilal baray gharray hain; fidar tukray hain; rahl se murad kajaawa rakhna hai.)"
"1327","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ke din paaltu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya aur ghodon ke gosht mein ijazat di. (Muslim: 6/66)"
"1328","[AI-translation] Asma (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein ghoda zibah kiya aur usay khaya. (Muslim: 6/66). Baab: Paaltu gadhon ka gosht khanay se mumaniat."
"1329","[AI-translation] Abu Salaba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne paaltu gadhon ka gosht haraam kiya. (Muslim: 6/62)"
"1330","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar fatah kiya to hamein basti se bahar gadhay milay. To ham ne un mein se pakaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munadi ne pukara: Khabardar! Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasool tumhein un se manay kartay hain, beshak wo shaitaan ke kaam mein se gandagi hain. To degchein un sameet jo un mein tha undhel di gayeen jabke wo un sameet jo un mein tha josh maar rahi thin. (Muslim: 6/65). Baab: Daar walay darindon ka gosht khanay se mumaniat."
"1331","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Daar walay darindon mein se har aik ka khana haraam hai. (Muslim: 6/60). Baab: Panjon walay parindon se mumaniat."
"1332","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne daar walay darindon mein se har aik aur panjon walay parindon mein se har aik ke (gosht) khanay se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 6/60). Baab: Lehsan khana napasand hona."
"1333","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas thehray. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) neechay thehray aur Abu Ayyub upar. Unhon ne kaha: Abu Ayyub aik raat jaagay aur kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sar ke upar chaltay hain. To wo hatay aur aik konay mein raat guzari. Phir Abu Ayyub ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se upar janay ko kaha, lekin Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nechay aaramdeh hai, theharnay walon aur aanay walon ke liye. Isi liye Rasoolullah neechay thehray. Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Main us chhat par nahi reh sakta jis ke neechay Aap hon. Ye sun kar Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) upar tashreef le gaye aur Abu Ayyub neechay aa gaye. Abu Ayyub Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye khana tayyar kartay thay. Jab khana Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya jata, Aap us mein se khatay aur bacha hua khana lautaya jata, to Abu Ayyub (khadim se) poochtay: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ungliyan khanay mein kahan lageen? Aur wo usi jagah se khatay, barkat ke liye. Aik din Abu Ayyub ne khana tayyar kiya jis mein lehsan tha. Jab khana lautaya gaya to Abu Ayyub ne poocha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ungliyan kahan lageen? Unhein bataya gaya ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khana nahi khaya. Ye sun kar Abu Ayyub fikarmand hue aur upar gaye aur poocha: Kya lehsan haraam hai? Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, lekin main usay napasand karta hun. Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Jo Aap napasand karein main bhi usay napasand karta hun. Abu Ayyub ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas farishtay aatay thay aur farishtay lehsan ki boo se takleef patay hain, is liye Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usay na khatay thay. (Muslim)."
"1334","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kabhi khanay mein aib nikalta nahi dekha. Jab Aap usay pasand kartay to khatay, aur jab pasand na kartay to khamosh rehtay. Muslim mein hai ke jab pasand na kartay. (Muslim: 6/134). (Muslim mein ihram hai.)"
